VkJvNWZEeFo4ZnNreG4xdTJ5MHZqdlN4VXdFelFvWC03MGFZSS1KdEU0SGc4RUswS3VGVmNnX2hfQS03TzhVU0tnUUUzbzhZ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"Carrier Global (CARR) 將於週四發布季度收益"},{"title":"Carrier Global Corporation $CARR Shares Acquired by Nisa Investment Advisors LLC","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"Nisa Investment Advisors LLC 收購 Carrier Global Corporation $CARR 股份"}],"themes":[{"name":"資料中心","count":2},{"name":"財報","count":2},{"name":"併購","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-05","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1783180/000178318026000008/carr-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Carrier Global Corporation (\"we\" or \"our\" or the \"Company\") is a global leader in intelligent climate and energy solutions, focused on providing differentiated, digitally enabled lifecycle solutions to our customers. Our portfolio includes industry-leading brands such as Carrier, Viessmann, Toshiba, Automated Logic and Carrier Transicold, among others, that offer innovative heating, cooling and cold chain solutions to enhance the lives we live and the world we share. We also provide a broad array of related building services, including audit, design, installation, system integration, repair, maintenance and monitoring.","zh":"Carrier Global Corporation（「我們」或「我們的」或「公司」）是智慧氣候和能源解決方案的全球領導者，專注於為客戶提供差異化的數位生命週期解決方案。我們的產品組合包括開利、菲斯曼、東芝、Automated Logic 和開利 Transicold 等行業領先品牌，這些品牌提供創新的供暖、製冷和冷鏈解決方案，以改善我們的生活和我們共同的世界。我們也提供廣泛的相關建築服務，包括稽核、設計、安裝、系統整合、維修、維護和監控。"},{"en":"Through our performance-driven culture, we anticipate creating long-term shareowner value by investing strategically to strengthen our product position in homes, buildings and across the cold chain to drive profitable growth. We believe our business segments are well positioned to benefit from favorable secular trends, including the mega-trends of urbanization, population growth and demographic shifts, food security and safety, electrification, increasing demand for climate control and accelerated digitalization. Coupled with our industry-leading brands and track record of innovation, we continue to provide market-leading solutions for our customers.","zh":"透過我們以績效為導向的文化，我們預期透過策略性投資來創造長期股東價值，以加強我們在住宅、建築和整個冷鏈領域的產品地位，從而推動利潤成長。我們相信，我們的業務部門處於有利的長期趨勢中，包括城市化大趨勢、人口增長和人口變化、糧食安全、電氣化、氣候控制需求的增加和加速的數位化，從而受益匪淺。憑藉我們行業領先的品牌和創新記錄，我們繼續為客戶提供市場領先的解決方案。"},{"en":"In addition, we continue to invest in product and technology innovation within our core offerings and in new business models. Carrier Energy, our business offering new energy management solutions, is developing intelligent climate and energy solutions to meet future energy needs by optimizing home energy management, providing grid flexibility and unlocking energy capacity to support economic growth. This new business model is also expected to enhance the digital connection between the end-customers and Carrier, providing us with opportunities to offer services and aftermarket parts and components over the life of the product.","zh":"此外，我們繼續投資核心產品和新業務模式的產品和技術創新。 Carrier Energy 是我們提供新能源管理解決方案的業務部門，正在開發智慧氣候和能源解決方案，透過優化家庭能源管理、提供電網靈活性和釋放能源容量來支持經濟成長，從而滿足未來的能源需求。這種新的業務模式還有望增強最終客戶和開利之間的數位聯繫，為我們提供在產品生命週期內提供服務和售後零件的機會。"}],"markets":[{"en":"In May 2025, we announced changes to our reportable segments to better align our reporting structure with our business strategy, resource allocation and performance assessment. Under the revised segment structure, we globally manage our business operations through four segments: Climate Solutions Americas (\"CSA\"), Climate Solutions Europe (\"CSE\"), Climate Solutions Asia Pacific, Middle East & Africa (\"CSAME\") and Climate Solutions Transportation (\"CST\"). Each respective segment's major products, services and distribution methods are as follows:","zh":"2025 年 5 月，我們宣布對報告分部進行變更，以更好地使我們的報告結構與我們的業務策略、資源分配和績效評估保持一致。根據修訂後的部門結構，我們透過四個部門管理全球業務運營：美洲氣候解決方案（“CSA”）、歐洲氣候解決方案（“CSE”）、亞太、中東和非洲氣候解決方案（“CSAME”）以及氣候解決方案運輸（“CST”）。各分部的主要產品、服務及分銷方式如下："},{"en":"The Climate Solutions Americas, Climate Solutions Europe and Climate Solutions Asia Pacific, Middle East & Africa segments provide products and controls, services, and system solutions to meet the heating, cooling and ventilation needs of our customers while enhancing building performance, health and energy efficiency on a regional basis. Products and controls, services, and systems include air conditioners, heat pumps, heating systems, home and building energy management systems, aftermarket components, repair and maintenance services and rentals as well as modernization and upgrades through the product lifecycle. We serve a wide range of customers, including in the residential, commercial, education, healthcare, technology, retail, hospitality, data center, and infrastructure markets, among others. Products and controls, services and systems are sold directly to building contractors an","zh":"美洲氣候解決方案、歐洲氣候解決方案和亞太地區、中東和非洲氣候解決方案部門提供產品和控制、服務和系統解決方案，以滿足客戶的暖氣、冷氣和通風需求，同時提高區域內的建築性能、健康和能源效率。產品和控制、服務和系統包括空調、熱泵、暖氣系統、家庭和建築能源管理系統、售後組件、維修和保養服務和租賃以及整個產品生命週期的現代化和升級。我們為廣泛的客戶提供服務，包括住宅、商業、教育、醫療保健、技術、零售、酒店、資料中心和基礎設施市場等。產品和控制裝置、服務和系統直接出售給建築承包商"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"Each of our businesses is subject to significant competition from a number of companies throughout the world. Due to the nature of our products and services and the markets we serve, our competition can vary from regional or specialized companies to larger public or private companies.","zh":"我們的每項業務都面臨著來自世界各地許多公司的激烈競爭。由於我們產品和服務的性質以及我們所服務的市場的性質，我們的競爭可能從區域性或專業化公司到大型上市或私人公司。"},{"en":"The most significant competitive factors we face are technology differentiation, product performance, service, delivery schedule and price. Brand reputation, service to customers and quality are also important competitive factors for our products and services. While our competitive position varies among our products and services, we are a significant competitor with respect to each of our major product and service offerings. We believe that the loss of any individual contract or customer would not have a material adverse effect on our results.","zh":"我們面臨的最重要的競爭因素是技術差異化、產品性能、服務、交貨時間表和價格。品牌聲譽、客戶服務和品質也是我們產品和服務的重要競爭因素。雖然我們的競爭地位因產品和服務而異，但就我們的每項主要產品和服務而言，我們都是重要的競爭對手。我們相信，任何個別合約或客戶的損失不會對我們的業績產生重大不利影響。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Climate Solutions Americas","val":10470000000,"zh":"美洲氣候解決方案"},{"name":"Climate Solutions Europe","val":5044000000,"zh":"歐洲氣候解決方案"},{"name":"Climate Solutions Asia Pacific Middle East & Africa","val":3339000000,"zh":"氣候解決方案 亞太地區 中東和非洲"},{"name":"Climate Solutions Transportation","val":2894000000,"zh":"氣候解決方案 交通"}],"total":21747000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Product","val":19173000000,"zh":"產品"},{"name":"Service","val":2574000000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":21747000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":11136000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Europe","val":6092000000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":3841000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Other Geographical Region","val":678000000,"zh":"其他地理區域"}],"total":21747000000}},"peers":["OTIS","TT","RTX","CTVA","LHX"]}}